<title>USA: U.S. lead stocks up in November - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. lead stocks up in November - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lead stocks held by U.S. refiners rose to 8,633 short tons at the end of November from 7,777 short tons at the end of October, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Production of lead rose to 28,817 short tons in the month from 27,888 short tons in October.</p>
<p>Shipments from plants fell to 28,075 short tons in November from 33,608 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
